WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.030
Drop a pin on a map.

2
00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:03.650
A stretch of coast.

3
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.750
A dot.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.610
To the map, that's all it is: a location,

5
00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:11.390
with coordinates, a size, and distances.

6
00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:12.870
Now zoom in.

7
00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:14.190
A seafront.

8
00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:15.570
Rows of houses.

9
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:16.750
A corner shop.

10
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.410
People passing by.

11
00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:22.510
So is a place just a dot on
a map, or something more?

12
00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:26.790
In this mission, you'll test what
turns a location into a place.

13
00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:29.230
Then you'll compare
two real English towns,

14
00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:32.550
one on the coast, one west of London.

15
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.590
Your mission: decide whether
a place is just a dot,

16
00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.150
or something more.
